{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/2722","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/2722/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/2722/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/2722/events","html_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/issues/2722","id":96405454,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU5NjQwNTQ1NA==","number":2722,"title":"Replace only works inside a chord","user":{"login":"aarcro","id":279725,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3OTcyNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/279725?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro","html_url":"https://github.com/aarcro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarcro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":226418927,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjY0MTg5Mjc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/labels/Worker%20Hangs","name":"Worker Hangs","color":"E60026","default":false,"description":null},{"id":226428149,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjY0MjgxNDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/labels/Component:%20Canvas","name":"Component: Canvas","color":"f7c6c7","default":false,"description":null},{"id":226795379,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjY3OTUzNzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/labels/Status:%20Has%20Testcase%20%E2%9C%94","name":"Status: Has Testcase ✔","color":"0052cc","default":false,"description":null},{"id":235024002,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzUwMjQwMDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/labels/Issue%20Type:%20Bug%20Report","name":"Issue Type: Bug Report","color":"e11d21","default":false,"description":""},{"id":235027917,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzUwMjc5MTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/labels/Status:%20Needs%20Verification%20%E2%9C%98","name":"Status: Needs Verification ✘","color":"0052cc","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2015-07-21T20:06:25Z","updated_at":"2016-06-24T07:59:43Z","closed_at":"2016-06-24T00:27:03Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When using task.replace() as shown below, the task must be called in a chord not a chain. While I can work around this, it's probably best if replace worked in chains as well.\n\n``` python\n@app.task(bind=True)\ndef lazy_async_apply_map(self, items, d, runner):\n    \"\"\"Make new instances of runner for each item in items, and inject that\n    group into the chord that executed this task.\n\n    :param items: itterable of arguments for the runner\n    :param d: data to operate on (probably returned by a previous task)\n    :param runner: task signature to execute on each item. def runner(item, data, *a, **kw)\n    \"\"\"\n\n    subtasks = []\n    for item in items:\n        r = runner.clone()\n        r.args = (item, d) + r.args\n        subtasks.append(r)\n\n    raise self.replace(group(*subtasks))\n```\n\nTests:\n\n```\nt = generator.s(items) | lazy_async_apply_map.s(d, runner=generator.s()) | dict_reducer.s()\nt.delay().get()\n```\n\nHangs forever because the `celery.accumulate` task doesn't get connected to `dict_reducer`.\n\nBUT:\n\n```\nc = generator.s(items) | chord(lazy_async_apply_map.s(d, runner=generator.s()), dict_reducer.s())\nc.delay().get()\n```\n\nUsing chord instead of chain, this works completely as expected. I can post code for generator and dict_reducer if needed, but they are pretty trivial.\n","closed_by":{"login":"ask","id":1558,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1558?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask","html_url":"https://github.com/ask","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ask/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/2722/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/2722/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}